@startuml process_view_uc02_login_mfa_phase1_monolithique
title UC-02: Login and MFA (Phase 1 Monolithique)
autonumber

actor Client
participant "API Router" as Router
participant "Identity Handler" as Handler
participant "Identity Service" as Identity
participant "Auth/JWT Engine" as Auth
database "MySQL" as DB

== Étape 1: Obtention du Jeton MFA ==
Client -> Router: POST /api/v1/identity/login
Router -> Handler: Forward Request
Handler -> Identity: Login(req)
activate Identity
Identity -> DB: SELECT * FROM users WHERE email=?
DB --> Identity: User details
Identity -> Identity: Verify Password
Identity -> Auth: Generate MFA Token (Role: PRE_AUTH)
Auth --> Identity: MFA Token
Identity --> Handler: LoginResponse (mfaToken)
deactivate Identity
Handler --> Client: 200 OK + mfaToken

== Étape 2: Vérification MFA & Jeton d'accès ==
Client -> Router: POST /api/v1/identity/login/mfa (mfaToken, code)
Router -> Handler: Forward Request
Handler -> Identity: VerifyMFA(req)
activate Identity
Identity -> Auth: Validate MFA Token
Auth --> Identity: Token Valid (Role == PRE_AUTH)
Identity -> Identity: Verify OTP code (mock)
Identity -> Auth: Generate Access Token (Role: USER)
Auth --> Identity: Access Token
Identity -> DB: INSERT INTO sessions
DB --> Identity: Success
Identity --> Handler: HTTP TokenResponse
deactivate Identity
Handler --> Client: 200 OK + accessToken

@enduml
